   "pausa": 1.0,
   "vel": 0.82
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the intercom: this is your driver. Stay in your car. Count yourselves.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "So we counted. One, two, three, four, five, six.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "We counted again. Seven.",
